content='Based on the balance sheet in the filing, Amcor's year end FY2020 net accounts receivable (AR) is $1,615.9 million. 

This can be found on the Consolidated Balance Sheet under the "Trade receivables, net" line item for the year ended June 30, 2020.

The financial analyst would note that this figure represents the net trade receivables after allowance for doubtful accounts, which was $35.3 million as of June 30, 2020, as disclosed in the accounting policies section under "Trade Receivables, Net".' additional_kwargs={} response_metadata={'id': 'msg_01NohCfxUWLepZjG9sSTv94y', 'model': 'claude-3-5-haiku-20241022', 'stop_reason': 'end_turn', 'stop_sequence': None, 'usage': {'input_tokens': 50864, 'output_tokens': 134, 'cache_creation_input_tokens': 0, 'cache_read_input_tokens': 0}} id='run-d905c0fb-143a-48eb-98a7-624635375449-0' usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 50864, 'output_tokens': 134, 'total_tokens': 50998, 'input_token_details': {'cache_read': 0, 'cache_creation': 0}}

content='Based on the filing, MGM Resorts did not pay dividends to common shareholders in fiscal year 2022 in the traditional sense. While the company technically paid a nominal dividend of $0.0025 per share in March, June, September, and December 2022 (totaling $4 million for the year), on February 8, 2023, the Board of Directors announced the suspension of ongoing regular dividends. 

Specifically, the filing states: "On February 8, 2023, we announced that the Board of Directors has determined to suspend the ongoing regular dividends in order to focus on our preferred method of returning value to shareholders through our share repurchase plan."

So while a minimal dividend was technically paid in 2022, it was essentially a token amount, and the company has since suspended dividend payments altogether.' additional_kwargs={} response_metadata={'id': 'msg_01Evq8drhZubvbeq9PknA4ov', 'model': 'claude-3-5-haiku-20241022', 'stop_reason': 'end_turn', 'stop_sequence': None, 'usage': {'input_tokens': 50496, 'output_tokens': 183, 'cache_creation_input_tokens': 0, 'cache_read_input_tokens': 0}} id='run-b16246da-12ac-4dd7-9b40-ed032876cbad-0' usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 50496, 'output_tokens': 183, 'total_tokens': 50679, 'input_token_details': {'cache_read': 0, 'cache_creation': 0}}
